[38;2;124;124;124mto be a power of 2, meaning 2a'b'-c' is a power of 2). Similarly bc-a = 2(2b'c'-[0m[38;2;124;124;124ma'), ca-b = 2(2c'a'-b'). So (a',b',c') satisfies 2a'b'-c', 2b'c'-a', 2c'a'-b' [0m
