[38;2;124;124;124mLet me think about the structure differently. Let me consider the sum:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m(ab-c) + (bc-a) + (ca-b) = ab+bc+ca - a - b - c = 2^u + 2^v + 2^w.[0m

