[38;2;124;124;124mInteresting, in all cases u ≤ w ≤ v (with a ≤ b ≤ c). Let me verify: with a ≤ b [0m[38;2;124;124;124m≤ c, bc ≥ ca ≥ ab. And a ≤ b ≤ c. So bc - a ≥ ca - b ≥ ab - c? Let's check: bc -[0m[38;2;124;124;124ma vs ca - b: bc - a - (ca - b) = bc - ca - a + b = c(b-a) + (b-a) = (b-a)(c+1) ≥[0m[38;2;124;124;124m0. So bc-a ≥ ca-b. And ca - b vs ab - c: ca - b - (ab - c) = ca - ab - b + c = [0m
[38;2;124;124;124ma(c-b) + (c-b) = (c-b)(a+1) ≥ 0. So ca-b ≥ ab-c.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSo 2^v ≥ 2^w ≥ 2^u, meaning v ≥ w ≥ u. [0m

[38;2;124;124;124mNow using the identities:[0m
